\item[S2] David Aldous and Tamar Lando, \emph{The stretch-length tradeoff in geometric networks: average case and worst case study}, Mathematical Proceedings of the Cambridge Philosophical Society 159 (2015), 125--145, Section 1, definitions and scaling question, pp. 1--3; Section 2, existence of limits. \url{https://www.stat.berkeley.edu/~aldous/Papers/me142.pdf}.
